      "created_at": "2025-12-15T06:14:48.214Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Both Node.js 18 and 20 can be used in production. Use <code>nvm</code> to switch versions as needed (<code>nvm use 18</code> or <code>nvm use 20</code>)</p>",
